{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["קלעים — Menachem explained: the matter of the tent curtains. And a second sense he explained: ״וּקְלַעְתָּ אֲלֵיהֶם מַקְלְעוֹת כְּרֻבִים מַקְלְעוֹת פְּקָעִים״ — the matter of carving, these. And I say: one may say that even the קלעים of the court of the Tabernacle were made in the manner of hangings and designs."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:18.330480306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}